{"path":"numeric/random/subtract_with_carry_engine/seed","title":"std::subtract_with_carry_engine<UIntType,w,s,r>::seed","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::subtract_with_carry_engine&lt;UIntType,w,s,r&gt;::</span>seed","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/numeric/random/subtract_with_carry_engine/seed","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Sets the state of the random-number engine.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> seed<span class=\"br0\">(</span> result_type value <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> 0u <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td><div><span id=\"Version_2\"></span><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> SeedSeq <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <br><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> seed<span class=\"br0\">(</span> SeedSeq<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> seq <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Sets the <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/subtract_with_carry_engine#Generator_properties\">state</a> of the random-number engine.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Right after the state is set, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/subtract_with_carry_engine\"><span class=\"kw1490\">std::<span class=\"me2\">subtract_with_carry_engine</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>value<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Right after the state is set, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/subtract_with_carry_engine\"><span class=\"kw1490\">std::<span class=\"me2\">subtract_with_carry_engine</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>seq<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> value\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> seed value to use to set the state\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> seq\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> seed sequence to use to set the state\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> If <code>SeedSeq</code> is not <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/seed_seq\">std::seed_seq</a></span>, throws the exceptions thrown by the <code>seq.generate</code> call.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Same as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/subtract_with_carry_engine\"><span class=\"kw1490\">std::<span class=\"me2\">subtract_with_carry_engine</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>value<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Same as <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/subtract_with_carry_engine\"><span class=\"kw1490\">std::<span class=\"me2\">subtract_with_carry_engine</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>seq<span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue2181\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 2181</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++11\n</td>\n<td>overload <span class=\"t-v\">(<a href=\"#Version_2\">2</a>)</span> would not throw even if the <code>seq.generate</code> call throws\n</td>\n<td>propagates the exception\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue3809\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 3809</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++11\n</td>\n<td>the default argument of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> was <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">default_seed</span></code>\n</td>\n<td>changed to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">0u</span></code>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/random/subtract_with_carry_engine/subtract_with_carry_engine\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs the engine <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics library"},{"path":"numeric/random","title":"Pseudo-random number generation"},{"path":"numeric/random/subtract_with_carry_engine","title":"std::subtract_with_carry_engine"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::subtract_with_carry_engine<UIntType,w,s,r>::seed","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Sets the state of the random-number engine."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"value, seq"},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"If SeedSeq is not std::seed_seq, throws the exceptions thrown by the seq.generate call."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Same as std::subtract_with_carry_engine(value)."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs the engine"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":160,"codeBlockCount":0}
